    /// Reader-facing title, e.g. "Week of Jun 22–28".
    var title: String
    /// The full rendered report (CoachReportView's markdown dialect).
    var markdown: String
    /// Training days completed in the week.
    var workoutsDone: Int
    /// Distinct scheduled weekdays (0 when no plan has a schedule).
